direction: right
title: Cloud Native Enterprise Delivery Architecture

Container: 1. Containerization & Layering {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  app: Spring Boot Application
  docker: Multi-Stage Distroless Dockerfile
  oci: OCI Hardened Container Image
  app -> docker -> oci
}

GitOps: 2. CI/CD & GitOps Automation {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  git: Git Repository (K8s Manifests)
  argo: ArgoCD Controller
  rollouts: Automated Canary Rollouts
  git -> argo -> rollouts
}

K8s: 3. Kubernetes Orchestration {
  style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
  style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
  ingress: Ingress Controller (TLS)
  pods: Java Pods (HPA, Probes, Workload Identity)
  telemetry: OpenTelemetry & Prometheus
  ingress -> pods -> telemetry
}

Container.oci -> GitOps.git: Image tag updated { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
GitOps.argo -> K8s.pods: Reconciles live cluster state { style.stroke: "#10B981" }
